WEBVTT

NOTE
The lyrics of From Flaky With Love, timed to the music video for the karaoke on the
music page. Each cue is one line, sung from its start to its end; its id is the stanza
and the line in it (3.2: third stanza, second line). The times are the sung notes of the
song's vocal MIDI (the Suno stems of the international version), shifted to where the
music sits in the video, whose own audio has no vocals.

1.1
00:20.550 --> 00:22.682
You eat cookies all the day,

1.2
00:22.728 --> 00:24.860
Usually they taste okay.

1.3
00:25.201 --> 00:26.755
After cookie ninety-nine,

1.4
00:26.801 --> 00:29.522
The next one tastes like nasty slime.

2.1
00:29.858 --> 00:31.417
There’s no change in recipe,

2.2
00:31.462 --> 00:33.899
No cook ran off to urgently pee.

2.3
00:33.945 --> 00:36.092
“Flakiness” is what we say

2.4
00:36.138 --> 00:38.426
When sometimes things just go astray.

3.1
00:38.473 --> 00:40.735
That’s a monster’s daily job:

3.2
00:40.780 --> 00:43.068
Spice up life with every sob.

3.3
00:43.114 --> 00:45.406
If things always work okay,

3.4
00:45.452 --> 00:47.756
Life gets boring day by day.

4.1
00:47.804 --> 00:50.071
Here you are, your flaky test,

4.2
00:50.117 --> 00:52.880
Made with ❤️, like all the rest.

4.3
00:52.890 --> 00:54.753
Here you are, your flaky test,

4.4
00:54.800 --> 00:57.519
Made with ❤️, like all the rest.

5.1
01:09.481 --> 01:11.333
If I wake—the pipeline’s green!

5.2
01:11.374 --> 01:13.373
Time for me to intervene.

5.3
01:13.414 --> 01:15.686
In the night, ten tests were new,

5.4
01:15.727 --> 01:18.008
Let’s make one of those flaky too!

6.1
01:18.052 --> 01:20.345
Let’s speed things up, then make them slow,

6.2
01:20.389 --> 01:23.111
Timing troubles—off we go!

6.3
01:23.153 --> 01:25.152
Let’s not clean up the previous test,

6.4
01:25.193 --> 01:27.754
Leave some garbage for the rest!

7.1
01:28.106 --> 01:30.085
Somehow devs don’t quite like me,

7.2
01:30.131 --> 01:32.403
Especially those busy bees.

7.3
01:32.450 --> 01:34.630
But I try hard to entertain—

7.4
01:34.640 --> 01:37.403
A little chaos keeps them sane!

8.1
01:37.413 --> 01:39.402
Here you are, your flaky test,

8.2
01:39.595 --> 01:41.627
Made with ❤️, like all the rest.

8.3
01:41.637 --> 01:44.085
Here you are, your flaky test,

8.4
01:44.281 --> 01:46.419
Made with ❤️, like all the rest.
